547	  //   WALLET path (no `sold`): the credit rides on the fresh quote (promoCreditCents
548	  //     > 0), and we contend for it with an atomic INSERT inside the charge tx below.
549	  //   CARD/Stripe path (`sold` present): the credit was already RESERVED before the
550	  //     card was charged, and its hold token travels in `opts.promoReservationToken`.
