562	  //     its hold token travels in `opts.couponReservationToken`. We CONFIRM that hold
563	  //     inside the charge tx (never a fresh contended claim — that would double-count the
564	  //     global cap and collide on the per-person unique). No token => full-price order.
565	  const cardCouponToken = sold ? opts?.couponReservationToken ?? null : null;
