829	          // (lib/proration.ts) — otherwise the customer chooses the rate for each
830	          // half of a round trip by choosing the date, and pockets the spread.
831	          // `chargeCents` above is literally promoPriceCents(regular, promo), so
832	          // this scalar and the cash collected describe the same transaction.
833	          // A free admin grant recorded as 100: nothing was paid for these months,
834	          // so nothing may ever prorate out of them.
